{"about_the_game":"Beginning as a submission to the 2023 Big Mode Game Jam, Backpack Boy, a puzzle-platformer built around using special light sources to affect the world around you has been expanded to a full game with new levels and new mechanics.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThis short experience is packed full of fun and interesting puzzles.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExplore deeper to uncover the mysteries at the heart of the facility.  <br />\r\n<br />\r\nSomething is waiting for you...","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875150?t=1772591182","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2875150?t=1772591182","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772591182","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772591182","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3121480,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>Flashlight</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/acbd8b58262aab0c236ca20e4ea12c6c.poster.avif?t=1772591182\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/acbd8b58262aab0c236ca20e4ea12c6c.webm?t=1772591182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/acbd8b58262aab0c236ca20e4ea12c6c.mp4?t=1772591182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The Flashlight is the first and most important tool in your backpack.  Though, this flashlight doesn't just light up the dark.  It shines its way to <i>somewhere else.</i>  Use it to solve puzzles and explore a dilapidated facility that has been long abandoned.</p><br><h1>Lantern</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/1d1f02d1387e74910b62ab134c24edfa.poster.avif?t=1772591182\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/1d1f02d1387e74910b62ab134c24edfa.webm?t=1772591182\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/extras/1d1f02d1387e74910b62ab134c24edfa.mp4?t=1772591182\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>The second tool at your disposal is The Lantern.  Endowed with the same power as The Flashlight, these lanterns provide the ability to punch holes between here and <i>somewhere else.</i>  But what are they doing here?  And who left them?</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Beginning as a submission to the 2023 Big Mode Game Jam, Backpack Boy, a puzzle-platformer built around using special light sources to affect the world around you has been expanded to a full game with new levels and new mechanics.<br><br>This short experience is packed full of fun and interesting puzzles.<br><br>Explore deeper to uncover the mysteries at the heart of the facility.  <br><br>Something is waiting for you...","developers":["Chuck","Niles Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2875150/header.jpg?t=1772591182","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2875150/830152/cfd524f26c599cca7f9c9d7e16e4caa80b22c876/1750949677/dash_av1.mpd?t=1739767299","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2875150/830152/cfd524f2